{"units": [{"i": 0, "p": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 3.6, "text": "Siang ini Jakarta terasa gerah, sekitar tiga puluh dua derajat.", "v0": 3.0, "v1": 6.6}, {"i": 1, "p": 0, "t0": 4.36, "t1": 7.53, "text": "Di saat yang sama, orang di Puncak masih memakai jaket.", "v0": 7.36, "v1": 10.53}, {"i": 2, "p": 0, "t0": 8.15, "t1": 10.23, "text": "Jaraknya kurang dari seratus kilometer.", "v0": 11.15, "v1": 13.23}, {"i": 3, "p": 0, "t0": 10.68, "t1": 12.39, "text": "Kenapa bisa berbeda sejauh itu?", "v0": 13.68, "v1": 15.39}, {"i": 4, "p": 0, "t0": 12.87, "t1": 14.92, "text": "Jawabannya ada di mesin iklim bumi.", "v0": 15.87, "v1": 17.92}, {"i": 5, "p": 1, "t0": 15.59, "t1": 17.95, "text": "Pertama, bedakan cuaca dan iklim.", "v0": 18.59, "v1": 20.95}, {"i": 6, "p": 1, "t0": 18.57, "t1": 22.54, "text": "Cuaca adalah keadaan atmosfer pada saat tertentu di wilayah yang sempit.", "v0": 21.57, "v1": 25.54}, {"i": 7, "p": 1, "t0": 23.22, "t1": 25.92, "text": "Misalnya, sore ini Bogor hujan lebat.", "v0": 26.22, "v1": 28.92}, {"i": 8, "p": 1, "t0": 26.48, "t1": 31.41, "text": "Iklim adalah rata-rata dan variasi cuaca dalam jangka panjang di wilayah yang luas.", "v0": 29.48, "v1": 34.41}, {"i": 9, "p": 1, "t0": 31.66, "t1": 36.22, "text": "Organisasi Meteorologi Dunia menetapkan acuannya minimal tiga puluh tahun.", "v0": 34.66, "v1": 39.22}, {"i": 10, "p": 1, "t0": 36.7, "t1": 39.68, "text": "Jadi, pembedanya adalah skala ruang dan waktu.", "v0": 39.7, "v1": 42.68}, {"i": 11, "p": 2, "t0": 40.27, "t1": 41.53, "text": "Unsurnya sama persis:", "v0": 43.27, "v1": 44.53}, {"i": 12, "p": 2, "t0": 41.78, "t1": 48.9, "text": "suhu, tekanan udara, angin, kelembapan, awan, curah hujan, dan lama penyinaran matahari.", "v0": 44.78, "v1": 51.9}, {"i": 13, "p": 2, "t0": 49.57, "t1": 52.56, "text": "Inilah besaran yang diukur setiap hari di stasiun cuaca.", "v0": 52.57, "v1": 55.56}, {"i": 14, "p": 3, "t0": 53.09, "t1": 57.03, "text": "Semua unsur itu digerakkan oleh satu sumber energi, yaitu matahari.", "v0": 56.09, "v1": 60.03}, {"i": 15, "p": 3, "t0": 57.7, "t1": 63.99, "text": "Karena bumi bulat, sinar matahari jatuh hampir tegak di sekitar khatulistiwa, tetapi miring di lintang tinggi.", "v0": 60.7, "v1": 66.99}, {"i": 16, "p": 3, "t0": 64.31, "t1": 69.07, "text": "Berkas sinar yang sama tersebar ke area yang lebih luas, sehingga kutub lebih dingin.", "v0": 67.31, "v1": 72.07}, {"i": 17, "p": 3, "t0": 69.73, "t1": 72.95, "text": "Pemanasan yang tidak merata inilah yang menyalakan mesin iklim.", "v0": 72.73, "v1": 75.95}, {"i": 18, "p": 4, "t0": 73.52, "t1": 74.46, "text": "Rantainya begini.", "v0": 76.52, "v1": 77.46}, {"i": 19, "p": 4, "t0": 75.09, "t1": 77.62, "text": "Beda suhu menimbulkan beda tekanan udara.", "v0": 78.09, "v1": 80.62}, {"i": 20, "p": 4, "t0": 77.81, "t1": 80.87, "text": "Udara mengalir dari tekanan tinggi ke tekanan rendah.", "v0": 80.81, "v1": 83.87}, {"i": 21, "p": 4, "t0": 81.54, "t1": 82.39, "text": "Itulah angin.", "v0": 84.54, "v1": 85.39}, {"i": 22, "p": 4, "t0": 82.77, "t1": 84.23, "text": "Angin membawa uap air.", "v0": 85.77, "v1": 87.23}, {"i": 23, "p": 4, "t0": 84.89, "t1": 89.54, "text": "Uap air naik, mendingin, menjadi awan, lalu turun sebagai hujan.", "v0": 87.89, "v1": 92.54}, {"i": 24, "p": 4, "t0": 90.17, "t1": 92.69, "text": "Satu unsur berubah, yang lain ikut berubah.", "v0": 93.17, "v1": 95.69}, {"i": 25, "p": 5, "t0": 93.22, "t1": 95.8, "text": "Lalu, kenapa iklim tiap tempat berbeda?", "v0": 96.22, "v1": 98.8}, {"i": 26, "p": 5, "t0": 96.06, "t1": 97.58, "text": "Karena ada pengendali iklim:", "v0": 99.06, "v1": 100.58}, {"i": 27, "p": 5, "t0": 97.93, "t1": 104.71, "text": "lintang, ketinggian tempat, sebaran darat dan laut, arus laut, relief, dan sirkulasi atmosfer.", "v0": 100.93, "v1": 107.71}, {"i": 28, "p": 5, "t0": 105.22, "t1": 109.93, "text": "Hati-hati, lintang dan ketinggian itu pengendali, bukan unsur iklim.", "v0": 108.22, "v1": 112.93}, {"i": 29, "p": 6, "t0": 110.59, "t1": 112.73, "text": "Sekarang, kita jawab pertanyaan di awal.", "v0": 113.59, "v1": 115.73}, {"i": 30, "p": 6, "t0": 113.17, "t1": 114.36, "text": "Coba kerjakan soal ini.", "v0": 116.17, "v1": 117.36}, {"i": 31, "p": 7, "t0": 114.8, "t1": 120.3, "text": "Menurut rumus Braak, T sama dengan dua puluh enam koma tiga, dikurangi nol koma enam kali h.", "v0": 120.8, "v1": 126.3}, {"i": 32, "p": 7, "t0": 120.73, "t1": 122.7, "text": "Ingat, h dalam ratusan meter.", "v0": 126.73, "v1": 128.7}, {"i": 33, "p": 7, "t0": 123.17, "t1": 127.78, "text": "Puncak berada sekitar seribu lima ratus meter, jadi h sama dengan lima belas.", "v0": 129.17, "v1": 133.78}, {"i": 34, "p": 7, "t0": 128.0, "t1": 131.01, "text": "Nol koma enam kali lima belas sama dengan sembilan.", "v0": 134.0, "v1": 137.01}, {"i": 35, "p": 7, "t0": 131.64, "t1": 137.79, "text": "Dua puluh enam koma tiga dikurangi sembilan, hasilnya tujuh belas koma tiga derajat Celsius.", "v0": 137.64, "v1": 143.79}, {"i": 36, "p": 7, "t0": 138.43, "t1": 139.08, "text": "Jawabannya A.", "v0": 144.43, "v1": 145.08}, {"i": 37, "p": 7, "t0": 139.5, "t1": 142.08, "text": "Pengendalinya adalah ketinggian tempat.", "v0": 145.5, "v1": 148.08}, {"i": 38, "p": 8, "t0": 142.87, "t1": 144.21, "text": "Jebakan yang sering terjadi:", "v0": 148.87, "v1": 150.21}, {"i": 39, "p": 8, "t0": 144.62, "t1": 147.99, "text": "h diisi seribu lima ratus, bukan lima belas.", "v0": 150.62, "v1": 153.99}, {"i": 40, "p": 8, "t0": 148.53, "t1": 152.01, "text": "Hasilnya minus delapan ratus tujuh puluh tiga derajat.", "v0": 154.53, "v1": 158.01}, {"i": 41, "p": 8, "t0": 152.58, "t1": 153.57, "text": "Jelas mustahil.", "v0": 158.58, "v1": 159.57}, {"i": 42, "p": 8, "t0": 154.04, "t1": 156.53, "text": "Ingat, h dalam ratusan meter.", "v0": 160.04, "v1": 162.53}, {"i": 43, "p": 9, "t0": 157.07, "t1": 158.91, "text": "Itulah konsep dasar Bab Iklim.", "v0": 163.07, "v1": 164.91}, {"i": 44, "p": 9, "t0": 159.13, "t1": 168.49, "text": "Di olimpiade, materi yang paling sering muncul adalah El Nino, La Nina, dan I O D, serta efek rumah kaca dan pemanasan global.", "v0": 165.13, "v1": 174.49}, {"i": 45, "p": 9, "t0": 169.15, "t1": 176.83, "text": "Berikutnya ada sirkulasi atmosfer dan monsun, klasifikasi iklim, suhu udara, serta awan dan hujan.", "v0": 175.15, "v1": 182.83}, {"i": 46, "p": 9, "t0": 177.49, "t1": 180.22, "text": "Semuanya kita bahas satu per satu di video berikutnya.", "v0": 183.49, "v1": 186.22}, {"i": 47, "p": 10, "t0": 180.75, "t1": 187.13, "text": "Latihan soalnya ada di O S N Geo titik I D, menu Soal Pendalaman Materi, Bab satu.", "v0": 186.75, "v1": 193.13}, {"i": 48, "p": 10, "t0": 187.71, "t1": 188.7, "text": "Sampai jumpa!", "v0": 193.71, "v1": 194.7}], "words": [{"w": "Siang", "t": 3.0, "u": 0}, {"w": "ini", "t": 3.3, "u": 0}, {"w": "Jakarta", "t": 3.6, "u": 0}, {"w": "terasa", "t": 4.05, "u": 0}, {"w": "gerah,", "t": 4.5, "u": 0}, {"w": "sekitar", "t": 4.8, "u": 0}, {"w": "tiga", "t": 5.25, "u": 0}, {"w": "puluh", "t": 5.55, "u": 0}, {"w": "dua", "t": 5.85, "u": 0}, {"w": "derajat.", "t": 6.15, "u": 0}, {"w": "Di", "t": 7.36, "u": 1}, {"w": "saat", "t": 7.53, "u": 1}, {"w": "yang", "t": 7.86, "u": 1}, {"w": "sama,", "t": 8.03, "u": 1}, {"w": "orang", "t": 8.36, "u": 1}, {"w": "di", "t": 8.69, "u": 1}, {"w": "Puncak", "t": 8.86, "u": 1}, {"w": "masih", "t": 9.2, "u": 1}, {"w": "memakai", "t": 9.53, "u": 1}, {"w": "jaket.", "t": 10.2, "u": 1}, {"w": "Jaraknya", "t": 11.15, "u": 2}, {"w": "kurang", "t": 11.6, "u": 2}, {"w": "dari", "t": 11.89, "u": 2}, {"w": "seratus", "t": 12.19, "u": 2}, {"w": "kilometer.", "t": 12.64, "u": 2}, {"w": "Kenapa", "t": 13.68, "u": 3}, {"w": "bisa", "t": 14.07, "u": 3}, {"w": "berbeda", "t": 14.34, "u": 3}, {"w": "sejauh", "t": 14.73, "u": 3}, {"w": "itu?", "t": 15.13, "u": 3}, {"w": "Jawabannya", "t": 15.87, "u": 4}, {"w": "ada", "t": 16.5, "u": 4}, {"w": "di", "t": 16.82, "u": 4}, {"w": "mesin", "t": 16.97, "u": 4}, {"w": "iklim", "t": 17.29, "u": 4}, {"w": "bumi.", "t": 17.6, "u": 4}, {"w": "Pertama,